  "title": "Depression Cake I",
  "description": "This Depression-era cake is a family recipe that has sugar but no eggs, butter, or milk. It uses shortening, raisins, flour, and spices for flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "LYNN SEVERNS"
  ],
